        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Please don’t buy these machines. Parts are not available or are very difficult to obtain the correct ones and it doesn’t line cold weather. It blows the transmission filter off every day if it’s sitting outside in cold. I have one with 750 hours on it and it’s been sitting for 9 months now with no idea yet if parts will become available.\nPlease save yourself the trouble and don’t support these. Just don’t buy them.",
